  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Both are done:\n\n- **$12.00 refund** to your Visa ending 4242 for the missing beef pho (refund ID RF-4000). It should show up in 3\u20135 business days.\n- **$3.00 account credit** for the promo share. Your balance is now $3.00.\n\nSorry the missing pho cost you a bit of a headache, Owen. Thanks for your patience."
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Thanks, that works for me. I'll keep an eye out for the $12 on my Visa over the next few days. Appreciate you sorting it out."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "You're welcome, Owen. The $12.00 should appear on your Visa ending 4242 within 3\u20135 business days. Enjoy your meal, and have a good night!"
